        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Once I have the right length, how do I use a chain breaker to open my bike chain?",
          "user_rubrik": "How do I use a chain breaker to open my bike chain?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To open your bike chain with a chain breaker, first, get a chain tool. Insert a link into the tool, aligning the tool's pin with one of the chain's pins. Turn the handle clockwise to push the pin out, then turn it counterclockwise to retract the tool's pin. Finally, wiggle the link to separate the chain.",
