        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I don\u2019t have a chain tool yet, but it sounds manageable. Would most bike shops size and install a new chain for you if you bring one in?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is the perfect length of a chain for a bike?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Yes, most bike shops typically offer services like sizing and installing new chains. This is a common service provided by professional workshops, especially for tasks that require specific tools like a chain tool or mechanical know-how. They are equipped to handle such maintenance, particularly if you lack the necessary tools or expertise.",
